      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "제대로 들어갔다고!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ちゃんと効いてるじゃない！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_005.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 26,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "보고 있어? 엘리사!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "エリサ、見てる？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_006.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 27,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "저 녀석, 완전히 얼어버렸어!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あいつ、完全に固まってるわ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_007.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 28,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitMotion": "SAD",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하… 하지만… 전 이제 더럽혀져 버린 거예요…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "で…でも…私は汚れてしまいました…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_010.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 29,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "신을 섬기는 몸으로 이런 망측한 짓을 해 버리다니…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "神に仕える者として、あるまじき行為です…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_011.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 30,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "전 결국 타락한 성녀가 되어 교단을 무너트리고 다른 성녀들을 전부 화형시켜 버리겠죠…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "このまま堕落した聖女になって教団を崩壊させ、他の聖女の皆さんを火あぶりに…！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_012.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 31,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "EmotionEffect": "EMARK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "화, 화형?!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ひ、火あぶり！？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_008.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 32,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "거, 걱정 마세요! 뮤리엘 116번 성녀님!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "し、心配しないでください！序列116番聖女ことミュリエル様！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_013.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 33,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "뮤리엘 님만은 특별히 화형 대신 마왕 강림을 위한 인신 공양의 제물로 써 드릴게요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ミュリエル様だけは特別に、火あぶりの代わりに魔王召喚のための生贄にして差しあげます！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_014.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 34,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "환각제에 잔뜩 취하면 고통은 별로 느껴지지 않을 거예요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "幻覚剤をたっぷり使えば、痛みはあまり感じないはずです！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_015.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 35,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "BgCrash": 0.5,
      "BgCrashTime": 1.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "EmotionEffect": "UPSET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "끄, 끔찍한 소리 그만해!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ぶ、物騒なことを言うんじゃないわよ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_009.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 122,
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 36,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "네가 타락할 것 같으면 두들겨 패서라도 정신 차리게 해 줄 테니까!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あんたが堕落したら、殴ってでも正気に戻してあげるわ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_010.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 37,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "저, 정말인가요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ほ、本当ですか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_016.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 38,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "역시… 절 생각해 주시는 건 뮤리엘 님뿐이에요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "やはり…私のことを真に思ってくれているのは、ミュリエル様だけです！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_017.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 39,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitMotion": "SAD",
      "EmotionEffect": "HEART",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "뮤리엘 님… 영원히 함께야…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私はミュリエル様と…永遠を共に…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_018.wav"
    },
    {
