      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "EmotionEffect": "STRESS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그… 질척거리는 소리도 그만하고…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "その…なんか重い感じのセリフもやめなさい…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_2_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_011.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 41,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
